					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Libellum (reverende in Christo pater), quem legendum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>miseras, remitto et quidem tibi, quas debeo, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>gratias habeo.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Mitto praeterea quaedam nova <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ex conclavi, quae si nondum habetis, spero vobis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>non ingrata futura.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed tu haec omnia per <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>certum hominem remittas; sunt enim d. <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>oratoris, qui haec nobiscum communicat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Novi <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>pręterea habeo nihil.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, reverende in Christo <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>pater, cum omnibus tuis quam felicissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salvum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>te cupiunt nostri omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Expecto literas <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>a d. <persName ref="p487">Heinrycho</persName> filio, cuius ego silentium tam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>diuturnum miror.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale iterum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 4. decembris <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>anno 1559.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/><persName ref="p8009">Ioannes Fabricius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>tui observantissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Rogo te te, reverende pater, has literas d. <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>reddendas cures, - est in illis coronatus -, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>sed et propinquę, viduae <persName ref="p1753">Leonis</persName>, suas, in quibus est <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>thalerus; propterea diligentius velim curatas.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Quod ad <persName ref="p2664">Quadrii</persName> negocium, spero divinam clementiam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>nobis provisuram.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Boni certe viri iique quam plurimi, quorum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>animos exploratos habemus, strenue obviam ibunt; <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>sed et papistae huic novo instituto contradicunt; sed et <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nostri non multum in gratiam <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandi</persName> facturi sunt.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Causas <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>audies alias.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro eruditio<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ne et pietate excellenti d. <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> antistiti <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>vigilantissimo, d. et <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>patrono suo multum <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>observando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>